+ ```scala

- val name = t"Hamlet"
+ val name = t"Hamlet"

- val contact = tel"name $name"
+ val contact = tel"name $name"

= val contact = tel"name $name"
- ```
+ ```

- The same syntax is a pattern, which binds the values it names:
+ La stessa sintassi è un pattern, che lega i valori che nomina:

= The same syntax is a pattern, which binds the values it names:
=
